OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight with further outbreaks of
OL,8,Frain, but turning generally lighter
OL,9,Fand more patchy as winds ease
OL,10,Fovernight. Turning heavier again in
OL,11,Fsouthwest towards morning.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FIt will stay cloudy with
OL,14,Ffurther outbreaks of rain, mostly
OL,15,Flight and patchy in the east, but
OL,16,Fheavier at times in the southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
