OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FCloudy clearing Thursday morning.
OL,7,FLargely dry and bright but chilly the
OL,8,Frest of Thursday and Friday, cloudier
OL,9,Fwith some showers in east. Mostly dry
OL,10,Fand bright Saturday, cloudier in west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
